      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The petitioner has been made accused in connection with Sadar P.S. Case No. 175 of 2024,\ncorresponding to POCSO Case No.37 of 2024, for the offences registered under Sections 376/506 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 4 of the POCSO Act, pending in the court of Shri Amresh Kumar,\nlearned Special Judge (POCSO) Act, Chatra.\nIn the midnight 07.05.2024, the petitioner is alleged to have raped the victim.\nAttention has been drawn towards the deposition of the victim recording during trial as P.W.3.\nFrom perusal of which, it appears that the victim has not supported the prosecution case and she has been declared hostile.\nIn view of the aforesaid facts, I am inclined to release the petitioner, on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
